+        "trace": "Product_Attributes::process_form_submission() first validates save_attribute_mappings_nonce at lines 892-894, sanitizes posted arrays at 903-904, whitelists only existing attribute keys at 906-918, and writes only the fixed option self::OPTION_CUSTOM_ATTRIBUTE_MAPPINGS at line 939. The REST settings handlers similarly map request fields to hard-coded plugin option constants rather than attacker-controlled keys.",
