codex
Phase 2 report is written to [facebook-for-woocommerce-phase2.codex.json](/Volumes/External_Disk/timo/WORDPRESS-PLUGIN-RESEARCH/reports/phase2/facebook-for-woocommerce-phase2.codex.json).

Result: `0` TP, `0` REVIEW, `7` FP, `1` out-of-scope. The only real issue I kept was a low-severity open redirect in `wc_fbe_redirect` for `manage_woocommerce` users, tracked as out of scope because it needs privileged access and only appends non-secret onboarding metadata. The public `/fb_api/offers` route was refuted by the Meta-signed JWT verification and catalog binding, and the main AJAX/REST candidates were refuted by `manage_woocommerce` plus nonce guards or current-user-only effects.

Verification: the JSON parses cleanly with `jq`.
diff --git a//Volumes/External_Disk/timo/WORDPRESS-PLUGIN-RESEARCH/reports/phase2/facebook-for-woocommerce-phase2.codex.json b//Volumes/External_Disk/timo/WORDPRESS-PLUGIN-RESEARCH/reports/phase2/facebook-for-woocommerce-phase2.codex.json
